before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java

public class Main {

  public static void main(String[] args) throws InterruptedException {
    int[] result = {0};
    Thread worker = new Thread(() -> result[0] = 7);
    worker.start();
    worker.join();
    System.out.println(result[0]);
  }
}
```

